303 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 150 0 R
/E (Political intervention is currently the most plausible way that humanity can avoid catastrophe and there are many easy ways that anyone can help to improve the chance of useful AI legislation. If the thousands of people already concerned about superintelligence were well organised as a political force, they could wield substantial power to influence British AI policy.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
304 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 150 0 R
/E (Moreover, every month many more people notice how dangerous our current trajectory is. Awareness is accelerating rapidly as we get closer to catastrophe. PauseAI exists to provide useful structures and organise these people to have the most political impact as efficiently as possible.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
305 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 150 0 R
/E (Creating the political momentum for a pause)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
