343 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 152 0 R
/E (We reflect our relatively moderate demographic in our messaging. We adopt a more measured tone than a typical advocacy group. Our imagery is positive and inspiring. We emphasise that we are taking the moral high ground and we represent universal, common-sense human values as part of a historic cause. This also reinforces our absolute commitment to non-violence.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
344 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 152 0 R
/Pg 23 0 R
/A [765 0 R 0]
/K [10]
>>
endobj
