/P 155 0 R
/E (We have recently launched our volunteering and project management platform, Catalyse PauseAI UK. This is allowing us to activate new and existing volunteers more easily by presenting them with a set of actions that they can take and a clear path towards contributing to bigger and more involved projects that make a significant impact. It will enable us to better coordinate grassroots lobbying efforts and empower highly motivated individuals to launch their own projects to which they can recruit other volunteers.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [7 517 0 R 9]
>>
