377 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 156 0 R
/E (We will continue to grow our social media presence and respond to outreach from journalists, where we expect this to help to grow our brand or credibility. We would strongly benefit from being able to hire someone to lead our content creation. It is particularly important for us to invest in improving our website with high-quality articles and A/B message testing, because organic search engine results are one of the main pathways through which new people join PauseAI.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
378 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 156 0 R
/E (We will also be putting significant effort into fundraising. From the end of Q2, PauseAI Global will no longer be able to fund our operations. We will add pages to our website outlining our theory of change and track record. We will ask for donations from our community, as well as applying to large philanthropic funds.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [8]
>>
