451 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 159 0 R
/E (Our main funding scenario would give us the resources we need to scale our local chapters and headline events faster than ever before. We have had to de-prioritise traditional and social media work while we have only two staff, but we are keenly aware of the potential for growth in this area, so we would like to hire a communications specialist. Similarly, a dedicated policy consultant with strong experience and connections in politics would help us reach our policy goals faster. Half-time local group leads would strengthen our volunteer community and help scale our grassroots actions.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
