/T (Ambitious funding scenario \(covers 2 years\))
/E (Ambitious funding scenario \(covers 2 years\))
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
477 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (Our ambitious funding scenario would allow us to take on many more of the promising opportunities that we currently see for PauseAI UK. Offering higher salaries would make it easier for us to attract top-tier talent and by hiring more specialised content creators and allocating a substantial budget for video post-production, we would be able to grow our social media channels and create new funnels for recruiting volunteers. A dedicated community organiser would be responsible for assisting local groups and cultivating the social bonds that keep our volunteers consistently engaged.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [23]
>>
endobj
478 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 160 0 R
/E (A larger event budget would allow us both to hold larger conferences and to spend less time organising them \(for example, by hiring a conference centre\). With a large advertising budget we would hire a marketing agency to help us run highly impactful campaigns that catch the public imagination.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
