486 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 161 0 R
/E (Joseph is a researcher with over four years of experience in technical AI safety. He has been organising for PauseAI UK since May 2023 when he joined the very first protest. He is currently pursuing his PhD at Oxford University alongside his work for PauseAI UK. In 2021, he created one of the first text-to-image websites, which gained over one million users in less than six months. Before that he was a software engineer and studied mathematics.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [5]
>>
